% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The fields of a listing that name the kind (the listing format)
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"item type" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type (34 listings): the kind of product in the seller's words".
"type" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Type (6 listings): for example \"Type: Storage Bags\"".
"shoes type" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag".
"boot type" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag".
"handbags type" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag".
"types of bags" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag".
"shape" is a field of the kind of shoe or bag,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Kinds of footwear (Chapter 64). The shop's categories place pumps,
% slippers, sneakers and dance shoes among shoes.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"boot" is a word for the kind boot,
    as stated in ruling NY N320055, confer "is a woman’s, closed toe/closed heel, tall boot".
"boots" is a word for the kind boot,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type: BOOTS".
"women's boots" is a word for the kind boot,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes > Women's Shoes > Women's Boots".
"motorcycle boots" is a word for the kind boot,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Boot Type: Motorcycle boots".
"rainboots" is a word for the kind rain boot,
    as stated in ruling NY N276145, confer "slip-on waterproof rain boot".
"rain boots" is a word for the kind rain boot,
    as stated in ruling NY N276145, confer "slip-on waterproof rain boot".
"sandal" is a word for the kind sandal,
    as stated in ruling NY N196497, confer "is a women’s open toe/heel sandal".
"sandals" is a word for the kind sandal,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type: sandals".
"flip flops" is a word for the kind thong sandal,
    as stated in ruling NY N172458, confer "is a pair of women’s open-toe/heel thong sandals".
"pumps" is a word for the kind shoe,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes > Women's Shoes > Pumps".
"flats" is a word for the kind shoe,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type: flats".
"casual shoes" is a word for the kind shoe,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type: Casual Shoes".
"dance shoes" is a word for the kind shoe,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Sports Shoes,Clothing&Accessories > Dance > Dance Shoes".
"slipper" is a word for the kind slipper,
    as stated in ruling NY N302745, confer "below-the-ankle slipper".
"slippers" is a word for the kind slipper,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Item Type: slippers".
"women's slippers" is a word for the kind slipper,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes > Women's Shoes > Women's Slippers".
"sneakers" is a word for the kind sneaker,
    as stated in ruling NY N253189, confer "over-the-ankle, lace-up sneakers".
"casual sneakers" is a word for the kind sneaker,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "Shoes > Men's Shoes > Casual Sneakers".
