% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"pu" is a word for the footwear material polyurethane,
    as stated in ruling NY N125027, confer "polyurethane (PU)".
"pvc" is a word for the footwear material polyvinyl chloride,
    as stated in ruling NY N172458, confer "polyvinyl chloride (PVC)".
"tpu" is a word for the footwear material polyurethane,
    as stated in ruling NY N307346, confer "thermoplastic polyurethane (TPU)".
"eva" is a word for the footwear material ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer,
    as stated in ruling NY N296512, confer "ethylene vinyl acetate (EVA) plastic".
"tpr" is a word for the footwear material thermoplastic rubber,
    as stated in ruling NY N346370, confer "thermoplastic rubber (TPR)".
"rubber" is a word for the footwear material rubber,
    as stated in HTSUS Section XII and Chapter 64, confer "outer soles and uppers of rubber or plastics".
"leather" is a word for the footwear material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "It is unfair or deceptive to use the unqualified term “leather” or other unqualified terms suggestive of leather to describe industry products unless the industry product so described is composed in all substantial parts of leather".
"genuine leather" is a word for the footwear material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "It is unfair or deceptive to use the unqualified term “leather” or other unqualified terms suggestive of leather to describe industry products unless the industry product so described is composed in all substantial parts of leather".
"cow leather" is a word for the footwear material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "An industry product made wholly of top grain cowhide".
"cowhide" is a word for the footwear material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "An industry product made wholly of top grain cowhide".
"split leather" is a word for the footwear material split leather,
    as stated in ruling NY N251118, confer "a layer of polyurethane coating and a layer of split leather".
"suede" is a word for the footwear material suede leather,
    as stated in ruling NY N252193, confer "outer surface of 85% suede leather".
"bonded leather" is a word for the footwear material composition leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "An industry product made of a composition material consisting of 60% shredded leather fibers may be described as: Bonded Leather".
"mesh" is a word for the footwear material textile materials,
    as stated in ruling NY N359019, confer "100% polyester mesh knit fabric".
"air mesh" is a word for the footwear material textile materials,
    as stated in ruling NY N359019, confer "100% polyester mesh knit fabric".
"flock" is a word for the footwear material textile flock,
    as stated in the CN explanatory notes to Chapter 64, confer "the fibres (for example, textile flock), yarns, fabrics, felts, nonwovens".
"canvas" is a word for the footwear material textile materials,
    as stated in ruling NY L82909, confer "an exterior surface of 100% cotton canvas textile material".
"polyester" is a word for the footwear material polyester,
    as stated in ruling NY N065202, confer "an outer surface of 100% polyester textile material".
"nylon" is a word for the footwear material nylon,
    as stated in ruling NY M83255, confer "The lead is made of sturdy nylon woven webbing material".
"cotton" is a word for the footwear material cotton,
    as stated in ruling NY L82909, confer "an exterior surface of 100% cotton canvas textile material".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Materials of the outer surface of a bag: PU is sheeting of plastics in a
