% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"pu" is a word for the bag material sheeting of plastics,
    as stated in ruling NY N125027, confer "is a handbag constructed with an outer surface of polyurethane (PU) plastic sheeting".
"genuine leather" is a word for the bag material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "It is unfair or deceptive to use the unqualified term “leather” or other unqualified terms suggestive of leather to describe industry products unless the industry product so described is composed in all substantial parts of leather".
"leather" is a word for the bag material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "It is unfair or deceptive to use the unqualified term “leather” or other unqualified terms suggestive of leather to describe industry products unless the industry product so described is composed in all substantial parts of leather".
"cow leather" is a word for the bag material leather,
    as stated in the leather guides, confer "An industry product made wholly of top grain cowhide".
"split leather" is a word for the bag material split leather,
    as stated in ruling NY N251118, confer "a layer of polyurethane coating and a layer of split leather".
"suede" is a word for the bag material suede leather,
    as stated in ruling NY N252193, confer "outer surface of 85% suede leather".
"polyester" is a word for the bag material polyester,
    as stated in ruling NY N065202, confer "an outer surface of 100% polyester textile material".
"nylon" is a word for the bag material nylon,
    as stated in ruling NY M83255, confer "The lead is made of sturdy nylon woven webbing material".
"canvas" is a word for the bag material textile materials,
    as stated in ruling NY L82909, confer "an exterior surface of 100% cotton canvas textile material".
"cotton" is a word for the bag material cotton,
    as stated in ruling NY L82909, confer "an exterior surface of 100% cotton canvas textile material".
"paper yarn" is a word for the bag material paper yarn,
    as stated in ruling NY N338202, confer "constructed with an outer surface of twisted/rolled paper yarns".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% How high the shoe reaches, toe caps, waterproof, how the upper is fixed
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
"above the ankle but not to the knee" is an upper coverage that covers the ankle,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Upper coverage: Above the ankle but not to the knee\"".
"above the knee" is an upper coverage that covers the ankle,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Upper coverage: Above the knee\"".
"above the knee" is an upper coverage that covers the knee,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Upper coverage: Above the knee\"".
"knee-high" is an upper coverage that covers the ankle,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Boot Height: Knee-High\"".
"over-the-knee" is an upper coverage that covers the ankle,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Boot Height: Over-the-Knee\"".
"over-the-knee" is an upper coverage that covers the knee,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Boot Height: Over-the-Knee\"".
"stitching" is a word for the upper fixing stitching,
    as stated in the bags and footwear listing format, confer "\"Upper fixing method: stitching\"".
"injection molding" is a word for the upper fixing molding,
    as stated in ruling NY J84062, confer "(but may be assembled by ways other than those mentioned such as by molding or cementing)".
"sticking" is a word for the upper fixing cementing,
    as stated in ruling NY J84062, confer "(but may be assembled by ways other than those mentioned such as by molding or cementing)".
"straps across the instep and around the big toe" is a word for straps across the instep and around the big toe,
    as stated in HTSUS Section XII and Chapter 64, confer "consist of leather straps across the instep and around the big toe".

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% The rules: a word in the name or in a field
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
rule footwear_kind_by_name with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "A listing offers one finished product for sale":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the good is called a name
    and the name is a word for the kind the kind.

rule footwear_kind_by_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Shoes Type, Boot Type, Handbags Type, Types of bags, Shape: the kind of shoe, boot or bag":
the kind of a good is a kind
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is a field of the kind of shoe or bag
    and the value is a word for the kind the kind.

rule upper_material_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Upper Material (37 listings): the outer surface of the upper":
the constituent material of the upper of a good is a material
    if the field "upper material" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for the footwear material the material.

rule outsole_material_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Outsole Material (36 listings)":
the constituent material of the outer sole of a good is a material
    if the field "outsole material" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for the footwear material the material.

rule bag_material_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Main Material (13 listings) and Material (19 listings): the material of a bag or another product":
the outer surface of a good is of a material
    if the field "main material" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for the bag material the material.

rule main_material_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Main Material (13 listings) and Material (19 listings): the material of a bag or another product":
a thing is wholly or mainly of a material
    if the field "main material" of the thing reads a value
    and the value is a word for the bag material the material.

rule coverage_ankle with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Upper coverage (27 listings)":
a good covers the ankle
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is in ["upper coverage", "boot height"]
    and the value is an upper coverage that covers the ankle.

rule coverage_knee with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Upper coverage (27 listings)":
a good covers the knee
    if the field a field of the good reads a value
    and the field is in ["upper coverage", "boot height"]
    and the value is an upper coverage that covers the knee.

rule metal_toe_cap_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Whether with metal toe cap (19 listings)":
a good incorporates a protective metal toe-cap
    if the field "whether with metal toe cap" of the good reads "yes".

% Additional U.S. note 3: waterproof footwear is footwear designed to
% protect against penetration by water
rule waterproof_field with provenance HTSUS Section XII and Chapter 64,
        confer "\"waterproof footwear\" means footwear specified in the heading, designed to protect against penetration by water or other liquids":
a good is designed to protect against penetration by water
    if the field "whether waterproof" of the good reads "yes".

rule upper_fixing_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Upper fixing method (33 listings): how the upper is fixed to the sole":
the upper of a good is fixed to the sole by a process
    if the field "upper fixing method" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for the upper fixing the process.

rule upper_straps_field with provenance the bags and footwear listing format,
        confer "Upper fixing method (33 listings): how the upper is fixed to the sole":
the upper of a good consists of straps across the instep and around the big toe
    if the field "upper fixing method" of the good reads a value
    and the value is a word for straps across the instep and around the big toe.

% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% Tests
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

scenario shoes is:
    the field "item type" of boot 1 reads "boots".
    the field "upper material" of boot 1 reads "pu".
    the field "outsole material" of boot 1 reads "rubber".
    the field "upper coverage" of boot 1 reads "above the ankle but not to the knee".
    the field "upper fixing method" of boot 1 reads "stitching".
    the field "boot type" of boot 2 reads "rainboots".
    the field "upper material" of boot 2 reads "pvc".
    the field "outsole material" of boot 2 reads "tpr".
    the field "whether waterproof" of boot 2 reads "yes".
    the field "boot height" of boot 2 reads "over-the-knee".
    the field "upper fixing method" of boot 2 reads "injection molding".
    the field "item type" of shoe 3 reads "casual shoes".
    the field "upper material" of shoe 3 reads "genuine leather".
    the field "outsole material" of shoe 3 reads "eva".
    the field "whether with metal toe cap" of shoe 3 reads "yes".
    the field "item type" of sandal 4 reads "sandals".
    the field "upper material" of sandal 4 reads "air mesh".
    the field "outsole material" of sandal 4 reads "rubber".
    the field "upper fixing method" of sandal 4 reads "straps across the instep and around the big toe".
    the field "type" of warmers 5 reads "leg warmers".
    kinds expects answers ["the kind of boot 1 is boot", "the kind of boot 2 is rain boot", "the kind of shoe 3 is shoe", "the kind of sandal 4 is sandal", "the kind of warmers 5 is leg warmer"].
    uppers expects answers ["the constituent material of the upper of boot 1 is polyurethane", "the constituent material of the upper of boot 2 is polyvinyl chloride", "the constituent material of the upper of shoe 3 is leather", "the constituent material of the upper of sandal 4 is textile materials"].
    soles expects answers ["the constituent material of the outer sole of boot 1 is rubber", "the constituent material of the outer sole of boot 2 is thermoplastic rubber", "the constituent material of the outer sole of shoe 3 is ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer", "the constituent material of the outer sole of sandal 4 is rubber"].
    ankles expects answers ["boot 1 covers the ankle", "boot 2 covers the ankle"].
    knees expects answers ["boot 2 covers the knee"].
    waterproof expects answers ["boot 2 is designed to protect against penetration by water"].
    toe caps expects answers ["shoe 3 incorporates a protective metal toe-cap"].
